Third-party data
----------------

The leadership scenario pack (scenarios/leadership) is derived from the Hugging Face
dataset LLM-PBE/enron-email (https://huggingface.co/datasets/LLM-PBE/enron-email),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. That dataset is built from the Enron
Email Dataset distributed by Carnegie Mellon University (https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~enron/).

The messages were cleaned and pseudonymized into a fictional company before inclusion;
names, addresses and identifiers do not refer to the original people. See
docs/leadership-inboxes.md for the pipeline and how to reproduce it.
